  "description": "Capture the charm of a quiet countryside picnic with this Cottagecore Picnic Essentials Clipart Bundle, featuring 30 cozy digital illustrations in a soft watercolor aesthetic.\nThis bundle includes everything you’d need for the perfect dreamy picnic: baskets, vintage blankets, fresh fruit, thermoses, flowers, wine bottles, teacups, books, sun hats, and more — all isolated as high-quality PNGs with transparent backgrounds.\nDesigned in soft pastel tones with warm vintage charm, these cliparts are ideal for printable projects, planners, branding kits, wedding invitations, and cozy social media graphics.\n40+ PNG clipart files\nTransparent backgrounds (no white boxes)\n300 DPI (high resolution)\nDigital watercolor aesthetic\nElements include: basket, wine, jam jar, sandwiches, fruits, cheese, blanket, hat, flowers, teacup, camera, strawberries, boots, journal",
